msgstr "Tidak dapat merakam model kedua"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Model pertama anda telah disimpan, jadi log masuk muka sudah berfungsi. "
"Bilik mesti masih cukup terang untuk melihat wajah anda — tukar lampu "
"daripada mematikannya — kemudian cuba lagi atau langkau dan tambah model "
"kemudian daripada Tetapan."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Imbasan kedua: cermin mata, rambut wajah atau pencahayaan berbeza"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"Model pertama disimpan: log masuk wajah sudah berfungsi. Model kedua "
"menjadikan pengecaman lebih boleh dipercayai apabila sesuatu berubah: pakai "
"cermin mata yang kadangkala anda pakai (atau tanggalkan), rakam dengan "
"rambut wajah berbeza, dan ubah cahaya — hidupkan atau matikan lampu, jauhi "
"tingkap. Kekalkan wajah jelas kelihatan dan tekan Imbas sekali lagi; rakaman "
"berpandu ringkas yang sama akan menyusul."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci {} anda secara automatik menggunakan "
"pengesahan muka (dompet yang dikesan: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Menyemak perkakasan dan alatan TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci {} anda secara automatik menggunakan "
"pengesahan muka (dompet yang dikesan: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Perkakasan TPM dikesan. Memasang <i>tpm2-tools</i> secara "
"automatik..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci {} anda secara automatik menggunakan "
"pengesahan muka (dompet yang dikesan: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Perkakasan TPM 2.0 aktif. Kata laluan anda akan dimeterai "
"dengan selamat di dalam TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci {} anda secara automatik menggunakan "
"pengesahan muka (dompet yang dikesan: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Perkakasan TPM dikesan, tetapi pemasangan automatik "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> gagal. Jalankan <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Kembali kepada caching kelayakan berasaskan perisian."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci {} anda secara automatik menggunakan "
"pengesahan muka (dompet yang dikesan: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Status TPM:</b> Tiada perkakasan TPM dikesan. Menggunakan caching "
"kelayakan berasaskan perisian (AES-256-GCM)."

