#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Hanya satu model wajah didaftarkan. Cermin mata, perubahan rambut wajah atau "
"pencahayaan berbeza mengubah rupa wajah anda pada kamera, jadi satu model "
"sahaja boleh gagal (contohnya pada waktu malam di bawah lampu). Tambah model "
"kedua dengan atau tanpa cermin mata, dengan rupa anda yang lain, atau dalam "
"cahaya berbeza supaya buka kunci kekal boleh dipercayai."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Tambah model kedua"

