#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Pemberitahuan desktop dipaparkan semasa Ubuntu Hello mencari wajah anda, "
"kemudian melaporkan hasilnya. Percubaan yang gagal kekal dalam senarai "
"pemberitahuan."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Tunjukkan pemberitahuan"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Satu kad setiap percubaan pengesahan muka, dikemas kini dengan hasilnya."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Bunyi pemberitahuan"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Mainkan bunyi sistem untuk percubaan yang diiktiraf atau gagal."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Sertakan diagnostik"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan model, kepastian lwn. ambang, bingkai, kamera dan pemasaan pada "
"setiap kad. Berguna semasa melaporkan masalah."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Keselamatan"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Sejauh mana wajah anda perlu sepadan, dan sama ada Ubuntu Hello meminta anda "
"mengesahkan bahawa anda benar-benar berada di situ."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Ketegasan padanan wajah"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Cepat"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Seimbang"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "selamat"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Minta saya mengangguk untuk mengesahkan"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Selepas wajah anda sepadan, satu pemberitahuan meminta anda mengangguk. "
"Gambar yang ditunjukkan kepada kamera tidak boleh mengangguk."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Cincin kekunci / KWallet AutoBuka Kunci"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Dayakan pengesahan muka untuk membuka kunci cincin kekunci log masuk anda "
"secara automatik atau KWallet semasa log masuk. Ini dengan selamat menyimpan "
"kata laluan anda yang dimeterai dalam TPM apabila tersedia, atau disulitkan "
"dengan AES-256-GCM menggunakan kunci induk untuk root sahaja. Set pengesahan "
"wajah PAM_AUTHTOK untuk pam_gnome_keyring atau pam_kwallet5 bergantung pada "
"desktop anda."

