msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Buka pautan GitHub</a>"

#: src/main.ui:1020
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">Report a problem "
"or suggest a feature</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">Laporkan masalah "
"atau cadangkan ciri</a>"

#: src/main.ui:1032
msgid "About"
msgstr "Tentang"

#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Selamat datang ke Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.ui:52
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Persediaan selesai!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:68
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Kami sudah selesai! Ubuntu Hello kini aktif pada komputer ini. Cuba lakukan "
"apa sahaja yang anda biasanya perlu menaip kata laluan anda untuk "
"mengesahkan, seperti menjalankan arahan dengan sudo. Jika anda mendayakan "
"kunci buka kunci automatik, cincin kekunci log masuk anda atau KWallet juga "
"akan dibuka secara automatik semasa log masuk.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh membuka Ubuntu Hello Configurator kemudian untuk menukar tetapan "
"yang lebih lanjutan atau menambah model tambahan. Tekan Selesai di bawah "
"untuk menutup tetingkap ini dan buka Ubuntu Hello Konfigurator."

#: src/onboarding.ui:105
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Menetapkan dasar kepastian"

#: src/onboarding.ui:121
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Kerana perubahan sudut, jarak dan faktor lain, padanan wajah tidak pernah "
"sama persis dengan model muka yang disimpan. Pada halaman ini anda boleh "
"menetapkan betapa ketatnya Ubuntu Hello sepatutnya."

#: src/onboarding.ui:160
msgid ""
"The most forgiving match and the quickest to let you in. Choose this if "
"convenience matters more than strictness."
msgstr ""
"Padanan paling longgar dan paling cepat membenarkan anda masuk. Pilih ini "
"jika kemudahan lebih penting daripada ketegasan."

#: src/onboarding.ui:191
msgid ""
"A strict match that still logs you in quickly. It may not recognise you at a "
"sharp angle or from further away."
msgstr ""
"Padanan ketat yang masih melog masuk anda dengan cepat. Ia mungkin tidak "
"mengenali anda pada sudut tajam atau dari jarak yang lebih jauh."

#: src/onboarding.ui:223
msgid "The strictest match, with no extra step when you log in. Recommended."
msgstr ""
"Padanan paling ketat, tanpa langkah tambahan semasa anda log masuk. "
"Disyorkan."

#: src/onboarding.ui:379
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Langkau buat masa ini"

#: src/onboarding.ui:384
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menambah lebih banyak model wajah kemudian dari Tetapan atau "
"dengan: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.ui:403 src/onboarding.ui:531
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Mengkonfigurasi kamera web"

#: src/onboarding.ui:435
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Adakah pemancar inframerah berkelip?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:447
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Lihat kamera yang anda pilih: kamera inframerah menunjukkan cahaya kecil "
"yang berkelip semasa Ubuntu Hello mengujinya. Ini memberitahu kami sama ada "
"ia boleh melihat wajah anda dalam gelap."

#: src/onboarding.ui:481
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Ya, ia berkelip"

#: src/onboarding.ui:507
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Tidak, tiada apa yang berkelip"

#: src/onboarding.ui:547
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello akan mencari sistem anda secara automatik untuk sebarang kamera "
"yang tersedia, jadi pastikan kamera web anda disambungkan. Selepas "
"pengesanan senarai kamera web yang boleh digunakan akan ditunjukkan. Pilih "
"yang anda mahu gunakan dan klik Seterusnya."

#: src/onboarding.ui:566
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Menguji kamera web anda, sila tunggu..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:613
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Memuat turun fail data"

#: src/onboarding.ui:629
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello memerlukan tiga set data pengecaman muka terlatih untuk dapat "
"mengenali anda, yang akan dimuat turun sekarang. Anda boleh melihat kemajuan "
"muat turun di bawah."

#: src/onboarding.ui:653
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Memulakan muat turun..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:697
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Selamat datang ke Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:709
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versi"

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Wizard ini akan membimbing anda melalui proses persediaan dan "
"mengkonfigurasi Ubuntu Hello secara automatik untuk anda. Tekan seterusnya "
"untuk meneruskan."

#: src/onboarding.ui:775
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci cincin kekunci log masuk anda secara "
"automatik atau KWallet menggunakan pengesahan muka, menghalang gesaan kata "
"laluan selepas log masuk."

#: src/onboarding.ui:787
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Dayakan cincin kekunci automatik/KWallet buka kunci"

#: src/onboarding.ui:815
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Sahkan kata laluan"

#: src/onboarding.ui:872
msgid "Back"
msgstr "belakang"

#: src/onboarding.ui:907
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Selesaikan persediaan"

#: src/onboarding.ui:934
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Seterusnya"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "Windows Hello style facial authentication"
msgstr "Pengesahan muka gaya Windows Hello"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "face;recognition;authentication;security;lock;"
msgstr "muka;pengiktirafan;pengesahan;keselamatan;kunci;"
